Description: A sleek chestnut thoroughbred with a white blaze running down his face. Rush is known for explosive starts and blazing speed, though he tends to tire in longer races.
+ 
Lore: Rush was born on a small farm in Kentucky, where he showed promise from his first days. As a foal, he would challenge the wind itself, racing across the fields at dawn. His previous owner, an elderly trainer named Marcus, recognized his natural talent but couldn't afford to keep him. Now at the mansion's stables, Rush runs not for glory, but to honor Marcus's memory and prove that heart matters as much as breeding.

